cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this project helps your course or paper, please cite it."
title: "AutoParking MATLAB"
abstract: >-
  A toolbox-free MATLAB automatic parking simulator with a Hermite forward
  approach, a 90-degree reverse arc into a perpendicular slot, path tracking,
  collision checking, a 1000-case Monte Carlo study (100% success, 0 collisions),
  and an interactive GUI with optional recording.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "masanli1"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-20"
license: "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
repository-code: "https://github.com/masanli1/autoparking-matlab"
keywords:
  - automatic parking
  - MATLAB
  - path planning
  - trajectory tracking
  - monte carlo
  - simulation
  - AGPL
